        "##### Définition de l'opérateur F  et de son adjoint :\n",
        "\n",
        "l'adjoint est :\n",
        "$$\n",
        "G(v)_{i,j} = \\left\\{\n",
        "\\begin{array}{lll}\n",
        "(0, 0, v_{i,j}), & \\text{si } i[2] = 0 \\text{ et } j[2] = 0, \\\\\n",
        "(v_{i,j}, 0, 0), & \\text{si } i[2] = 1 \\text{ et } j[2] = 1, \\\\\n",
        "(0, v_{i,j}, 0), & \\text{sinon.}\n",
        "\\end{array}\n",
        "\\right.\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "voir justification sur le pdf associe à ce projet\n"
      ],
      "id": "xx3PZYb15-8j"
